/private/var/folders/_q/qzh8_t6s15388qqf3p6n3d200000gp/T/bench-wq5iu7ie/CHANGELOG.md:23:- Split-file steps and workflows: define steps/workflows in individual files under `.bivvy/steps/` and `.bivvy/workflows/`; filename stem becomes the key
/private/var/folders/_q/qzh8_t6s15388qqf3p6n3d200000gp/T/bench-wq5iu7ie/CHANGELOG.md:41:- `bivvy run <workflow>` now performs a two-phase load: phase 1 reads only `.bivvy/config.yml` to resolve the workflow name; phase 2 deep-merges with only the named workflow file in the chain. Sibling workflow files are not parsed, so a malformed neighbor cannot break a run of an unrelated workflow
